A code line left of an authored-base fence opener is measured from that base

````
- ::: box
     ```
    x
     y
  :::
after
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">
      <pre><code>x
y
</code></pre>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
````

